{
  id: ["warhammer", "hammer"],
  adj: ["tempered", "steel"],
  name: "tempered steel warhammer",
  short: "tempered steel warhammer",
  long: "A short steel haft topped with a squared hammer face on one side"
        "and a stout, down-curved beak on the other. The face is for"
        "breaking what will break, and the beak is for what will not. The"
        "haft is bound in leather along the length of a forearm and"
        "finishes in a plain iron cap, and the whole of it is tempered hard"
        "enough to trouble a breastplate.",
